@startuml purchase-state
title PurchaseTransaction lifecycle (maps to your PurchaseState enum + IsConsumed)
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending   : Google purchaseState = 2\n(UPI / cash, not paid yet)
[*] --> Purchased : Google purchaseState = 0\nvalidated + rewards granted\n(same DB transaction)
[*] --> Failed    : Google error / fake token\n(log only - must NOT block retries)

Pending --> Purchased : payment completed\n(client retries validate or RTDN)
Pending --> Cancelled : payment never completed\n(no charge)

state Purchased {
    [*] --> NotConsumed
    NotConsumed : IsConsumed = false
    NotConsumed : must be consumed within 3 days
    NotConsumed --> Consumed : products.consume OK\n(MarkAsConsumed)
    Consumed : IsConsumed = true, ConsumedAt set
}

Purchased --> Refunded : voided purchase\n(refund / chargeback / fraud)\n-> deduct rewards
Purchased --> Refunded : not consumed in 3 days\n(Google auto-refund)

Failed --> Purchased : retry with valid token
Cancelled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
Purchased --> [*]
@enduml
